        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "A solution of Pr(NO3)3·6H2O (0.0870 g, 0.2 mmol) and H3L (0.0422 g, 0.2 mmol) in MeOH–MeCN (1:2, 15 mL) was treated with Et3N (0.2 mmol). The pale green solution was stirred for a further 5 min and then filtered. The filtrate was left undisturbed at room temperature for slow evaporation of the solvent. X-ray quality pale green single crystals formed after two days, were collected by filtration, and washed with MeOH.",
